  "description": "Our world championship-winning Quartz Frame is now available in a brand-new disc version, premiering our Sliding Dropout Disc System (SDDS). Utilizing a flat mount style calliper and internal cable routing for the best possible braking system; with this huge upgrade, the Quartz is now one of the lightest and most progressive alloy frames on the market!\n\n• NEW disc-brake-specific model with internal cable routing\n• forged and CNC machined Sliding Dropout Disc System (SDDS) with integrated chain tensioner\n• super lightweight alloy frame\n• x10 world championship wins\n• Paradigm superior tubing\n• flat mount disc brake only (not compatible with v-brakes)\n• Designed for 140mm and 120mm rotors (please check 120mm rotor fitment with an authorised Radio Bikes dealer based on your hub and brake calliper dimensions)",
